==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

